5,1,1,talk,May,,"Hello everyone! I'm looking forward to this. I think we should start by seeing what actually worked in the past, so I'll check the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A prudent start, May. I am more concerned with the operational reality of our staff. I shall examine the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I want to make sure we are solving the right problems for the passengers. I'll look into the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city and the journey audits on where minutes go.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to be here. I worry about the things we cannot see in the plans. I will look into the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells and the joint operators' committee minutes.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with the need for a balanced view. I shall examine the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
